1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,825
What does your dog really understand when you talk?

2
00:00:02,875 --> 00:00:04,234
More than you think.

3
00:00:04,284 --> 00:00:09,161
In one survey, owners said their dogs responded to about 89 words.

4
00:00:09,211 --> 00:00:12,080
Their name, sit, and come were the top three.

5
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:14,841
But a brain scan study found something cooler.

6
00:00:14,891 --> 00:00:17,911
Dogs process what you say on one side of the brain,

7
00:00:17,961 --> 00:00:19,810
and how you say it on the other.

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:24,545
Their reward area lit up most when praise words came with a happy tone.

9
00:00:24,595 --> 00:00:27,114
So a flat good dog doesn't hit the same.

10
00:00:27,164 --> 00:00:28,739
Say it like you mean it.

11
00:00:28,789 --> 00:00:32,672
Send this to someone who talks to their dog.
